= Co-Curricular Activities


- *General Secretary*, IEEE Student Branch, NIT Durgapur \[ April 2019 - Present \]
  -- Organized short-term courses and workshops for skill development.
  -- Collaborated with other Student Branches for various events.

- *Training and Placement Coordinator*, NIT Durgapur \[ March 2018 -  Present \]
  -- Determining all required placement requirements and assist all apprentice participants to exchange all information appropriately.
  -- Managing end-to-end campus recruitment processes of visiting companies which includes scheduling, logistics, hospitality and student management.

- *Developer*, NITDGPos, NIT Durgapur \[ March 2017 - Present \]
  -- Organized introductory presentations on Open Source and promoted participation in related events.
  -- Developed placement portal to facilitate job application through Django based web portal.
